摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"为 DSH Web GUI 带来新建对话命名、文件拖拽引用、编辑并重发上一条提示词、消息时间线，以及可拖拽的悬浮球与对话宽度控制","id":"gh:1430616772","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"DSH-Enhance","slug":"IndieXiaoLong/DSH-Enhance","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"为 DSH Web GUI 带来新建对话命名、文件拖拽引用、编辑并重发上一条提示词、消息时间线，以及可拖拽的悬浮球与对话宽度控制"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"dsh-enhance"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The missing conversation power-up for DeepSeek Harness ✨"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"New-conversation naming, file drag references, edit-and-resend for the last prompt, a message timeli"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ne, and a draggable floating ball with chat-width control for the DSH Web GUI."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"✨ Features ·\n📥 Install ·\n🚀 Quick Start ·\n🛠️ Development ·\n❓ FAQ"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> I use DeepSeek Harness every day. New sessions need useful names; finding a message in a long thre"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ad means scrolling; referencing a file means copying its path; correcting the last prompt should be "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"quick.\n>\n> So I built **dsh-enhance**: it leaves DSH’s native structure alone and just makes the dai"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ly actions smoother."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| | Feature | What you get |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| ✏️ | **New conversation naming** | Name it from the workspace `+` before creating it |\n| 📎 | **Fil"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"e drag reference** | Drag a file or folder into the composer as an `@path` |\n| ✍️ | **Edit & resend*"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"* | Stop a turn, edit the sent prompt inline, and send it again |\n| 📍 | **Message timeline** | Scan,"},{"id":"p10s4","text":" preview, and jump through long threads |\n| 🫧 | **Floating ball & width** | Everyday tools one click"},{"id":"p10s5","text":" away; 38–90rem live width |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> The GIFs below are recordings from DSH. The UI may look different with another theme or window siz"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"The GIFs below are recordings from DSH. The UI may look different with another theme or window size."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### ✏️ New Conversation Naming"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Name it before you create it.** Clicking `+` on a workspace title row opens a naming dialog instea"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"d of creating another “New Session”."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- Type a name and press Enter; **Skip naming** keeps the native one-click flow.\n- The name is writte"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"n as the conversation title; before the first turn, the sidebar blank row shows it.\n- Turn **Name ne"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"w conversations** off in the quick panel to restore the native behavior."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 📎 File Drag Reference"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Drop a file, get a reference.** Open the **Files** tab in the right sidebar and drag a file or fol"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"der row into the composer:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- The composer shows **Drop to reference <name>**; on release it inserts an `@relative/path` chip.\n-"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" The file is not moved, copied, or rewritten; the model reads it through its file tools when you sen"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"d.\n- Paths are relative to the conversation workspace root; paths with spaces use `@\"...\"`.\n- Folder"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"s are inserted with a trailing `/` (`@path/`) so the model can browse the directory.\n- The composer "},{"id":"p17s5","text":"gets an accent outline while dragging; dropping elsewhere inserts nothing."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### ✍️ Edit & Resend the Last Prompt"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Stop, tweak, send again.** When the conversation is idle, a **pencil** appears beside Copy in your"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" last sent prompt’s action row. Clicking it expands the prompt into a full-width inline editor with "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"mpt’s action row. Clicking it expands the prompt into a full-width inline editor with Cancel / Send:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- Edit the text, then click **Send** (or press Enter; Shift+Enter inserts a line, Esc cancels).\n- Se"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"nding forks the conversation **before the turn that carried that prompt** — including the queued inb"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ox copy — sends the edited text into the new branch, and opens it.\n- The branch keeps the earlier hi"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"story and title. The original is archived when archiving succeeds; otherwise it remains in the conve"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"rsation list.\n- Attachments are not resent; the editor warns when the original prompt had one."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> DSH's log is append-only and has no public \"rewrite this message\" call, so the edit is a **fork be"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"fore the turn + resend**, not an in-place mutation. The new conversation gets a new Session ID."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 📍 Message Timeline"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Never lose your place in a long thread.** A thin fixed timeline sits on the right:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- One node per question/answer turn; each node is anchored on the user question and covers the assis"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"tant reply.\n- Hover a node for the question, turn, and a content preview.\n- Click a node to jump to "},{"id":"p24s3","text":"the question; the top/bottom buttons jump to the first/last.\n- The `>` button collapses the rail; tu"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"rn it off/on in the quick panel."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 🫧 Floating Ball & Chat Width"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**Everyday tools, one click away.** Drag the floating ball anywhere; click it to open the quick pane"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"Everyday tools, one click away.** Drag the floating ball anywhere; click it to open the quick panel:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Tool | What it does |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| **Chat width** | Live 38–90rem, default **48rem**, one-click reset |\n| **Message timeline** | Togg"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"le the right timeline rail |\n| **Native turn navigation** | Hide the horizontal turn rail DSH draws "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"on the right (on by default) |\n| **Name new conversations** | Toggle the workspace `+` naming dialog"},{"id":"p28s4","text":" |\n| **Floating ball position** | Reset to the default corner |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Width syncs both ways with DSH’s native drag handle: dragging the handle updates the panel value; ad"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"justing the panel writes DSH’s width preference (`dsh.conversation.contentWidth`)."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## 📥 Installation"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1-rc.2` or a compatible 0.2.x Web composition.\n- Official Web / Desktop comp"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"osition (includes `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-workspace`).\n- File drag reference also needs the righ"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"t-sidebar **Files** tab (included in the official composition).\n- Works with both the desktop app an"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"Files** tab (included in the official composition).\n- Works with both the desktop app and `dsh web`."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Install from source"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"For the Web profile, use `dsh plugin --profile web add .` instead. Reload the Web page or fully rest"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"art the desktop app after installing."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Install from GitHub or Discover"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The repository includes prebuilt `lib/` files. Install it directly in the profile you use:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"For Discover, add this index URL under **Plugins → Discover → Index sources**. The npm package has n"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ot been published yet."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## 🧭 Compatibility"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"| Item | Status |"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| DeepSeek Harness | `0.2.1-rc.2` (compatible with 0.2.x) |\n| Web GUI | ✅ |\n| Desktop | ✅ |\n| Window"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"s | ✅ tested |\n| macOS / Linux | Expected to work, not tested |"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"The plugin uses only public DSH slots, DOM markers, public services, and CSS tokens; it does not rea"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"d private controller state. If a DSH upgrade changes those slots, markers, or services, the plugin m"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"er state. If a DSH upgrade changes those slots, markers, or services, the plugin may need an update."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
